{"ref":"BDB, עַכְבּוֹר","hw":"עַכְבּוֹר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַכְבּוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַכְבֹּר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>mouse</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עַכְבָּר\" href=\"/BDB,_עַכְבָּר\", dir=\"rtl\">עַכְבָּר</a>, v. Gray<sup>Prop. N. 93</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עכבר</span> OH and Ph. as n.pr. Lzb <sup>340</sup> (cf. also on simil. Lat. n.pr. Cl-Gann<sup>JAs 1883, Fev.–Mar. 128</sup>)<strong>)</strong>;—𝔊 Αχοβωρ:<br><strong>1.</strong>  Edomite <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:38\" href=\"/Genesis.36.38\">Gn 36:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:39\" href=\"/Genesis.36.39\">39</a> (P) = <span dir=\"rtl\">עַכְבֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:49\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.49\">1 Ch 1:49</a> (Baer Ginsb).<br><strong>2.</strong>  courtier of Josiah <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.12\">2 K 22:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.14\">14</a>, perhaps also <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.22\">Je 26:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.12\">36:12</a> (cf. Gie and Ency. Bib.).","next":"BDB, עַכְבָּר","prev":"BDB, עַיָּת"}